  "$comment": "Polymathie family manifest. The canonical machine-readable descriptor of the family, from which per-surface packaging (npm, JSR, CDN, Claude marketplace, MCP, design tokens) is generated or validated. Slots marked status 'published' are live; 'planned' slots carry proposed names for confirmation and are not yet real. Companion schema is manifest.schema.json; validate with validate.ts (deno run --allow-read validate.ts).",
